docs/artifacts/investment-copilot-prd.md:199:- **Auth to the Rails app:** the native shell holds a session like the browser does; no separate API auth. The MCP bearer token is never on the phone.
docs/artifacts/investment-copilot-prd.md:207:- Schwab app key/secret in dokku config vars; tokens encrypted at rest in Postgres.
